    ],
    "expectedRule": "Chapter 7 records the opening style of every non-boss fight (first attack, art or guard decides force, art or guard). A distribution is balanced when all three styles have won and the spread is at most 1; otherwise the counter is the most used style (ties force -> art -> guard), or none when nothing was recorded. Before the boss the display previews it: `尚无开局记录`, `偏科预警：力|术|守` or `开局分布均衡`, all stable. Selecting the boss writes a placeholder record {isBoss: true, style: null} and locks the assessment from the non-boss records: bossAssessmentLocked true and bossCounter the counter (null when balanced). Locked status reads `克制偏科：力|术|守` (danger) or `分布均衡，克制关闭` (resolved, targetReached). In the boss encounter the locked counter style loses 20% (force/art outgoing damage or guard effect). The player's real first action in the boss fight does not overwrite the placeholder. Title 终局回声, no meter. An art costs 1 focus and fights start at 0 focus, so the art opening first spends the gate_sense method technique (rank 1: +1 focus, not a combat action). Gates: citadel_force_identity_lane, citadel_art_growth_lane and citadel_guard_echo_lane open after one win with force, art or guard; citadel_balanced_core_lane (growth_mirror_trap -> main_god_echo) opens only for a balanced distribution and while closed reads `力、术、守均有胜场且次数差不超过 1 后开放。`. The pursuer is a separate run system and is disabled after entry so it cannot ambush the walk. All expected values are frozen here, never read from candidate code."
  },
